OL,3,AJagtar Singh Johal freed on bail after
OL,4,Anine years in Indian prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish Sikh activist has been
OL,7,Freleased from prison in India after
OL,8,Fbeing detained for almost nine years
OL,9,Fwithout being convicted.
OL,11,FJagtar Singh Johal, from Dumbarton, was
OL,12,Farrested in 2017 in connection with
OL,13,Falleged terror offences.
OL,15,FThe Indian authorities have accused the
OL,16,F39-year-old of having a role in a
OL,17,Fseries of targeted killings of
OL,18,Freligious and political figures -
OL,19,Fallegations which he denies.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
